WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Synthesized for the first time, the perception ability is improved, and it can distinguish the scent of large beasts within three kilometers. Survival information: There is a second victim camp five kilometers southwest of the herb forest.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,260
One victim camp can be considered a coincidence, but two must be noted. Come to the third one, I don’t believe it is still a coincidence.

3
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:21,260
Don't play God yet. This is the main house, and here is the storage passage. The main bed area must be away from the fire, and the eaves must extend at least this far, otherwise heavy rain will pour in.

4
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:22,260
Can.

5
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:26,260
Also, you said you want multiple independent rooms, are you planning to accommodate many people in the future?

6
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,260
Who says people must live there? Storage, medical care, and tools all need to be partitioned.

7
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:32,830
I thought they would reserve a room for us in advance.

8
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:33,830
You're thinking far ahead.

9
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:36,830
It's okay if you want people to live in it. It's easiest to leave partitions in the structure.

10
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:37,830
Listen to the professionals.

11
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:38,830
You pay the design fee.

12
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:46,560
Those who are willing to go can sign up by themselves, and the wages will be paid directly by Su Zhu. If we don’t go through me, what about our own collection?

13
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:50,560
It rotates every day, and no one can ignore the public water and fire just because they want to eat meat.

14
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:55,560
It is a personal decision whether to keep the wages personally or to hand them over. Whether you are willing to take part of the teeth back to England in exchange for other things is a personal decision.

15
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:57,560
Count me in. I collect in the morning and go to the construction site in the afternoon.

16
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:59,560
I'm going too. I'll sign up for class first. Is there any meat?

17
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:00,560
Discuss based on workload.

18
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:02,560
If everyone goes to build a house for him, who will take care of his own camp?

19
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:07,560
We don't even have a roof that can be used by party members. If we used to work, we could at least learn how to build it.
